    "long_instructions": "### Do This\r\n\r\nWith a partner, try different actions in the app and watch what happens. Find:\r\n\r\n- What are the inputs?\r\n- What are the outputs?\r\n\r\n**Example:**\r\n\r\n- **Input:** clicking the caterpillar picture\r\n- **Output:** the caterpillar gets bigger and a description appears"
